<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective from November 28 to December 4 the 1996:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 58.07</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 61.84</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 63.59</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 66.78</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$162.79</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$122.09</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 86.61</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 21.52</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.15</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 23.85</p>
</text>
